{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "7e88b7f7c50ec015353e95c1652f97c023ae8389d668a611f2af4b5fe7173758", "ja": "風は未来に吹いている", "zh": "风正吹向未来", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "7735802b7e05acf7d9e6c6f6de07817ab814616eedd339be73022973efd628b0", "ja": "ダンスに不安を抱える百合子。デビューから\n成長できているかも自信がないと語るが、\nここまでやり遂げてきたみんなの中に百合子\nもいると教えられ、プロデューサーとともに\n1ページずつ進もうと決意を新たにする。", "zh": "对舞蹈感到不安的百合子。她说自己也不确定从出道至今是否有所成长，但有人告诉她，一路坚持至今的大家中也有她的一份，于是她重新下定决心，要和制作人一起每次前进1页。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_02_1000_null", "source_sha256": "0a900af14edc78f3dfdcc341686addbf0d017d5c5e909405e13c09c91cfaa9e0", "ja": "テレビ出演に向けレッスン開始……", "zh": "为电视节目出演开始练习……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_02_1001_026yur", "source_sha256": "478408097ce9d682310a3c075e67c00e455262ad69efdd4125b187c166e250df", "ja": "いきなりダンスレッスンからかぁ。\nうう、プレッシャーだなぁ……。", "zh": "一上来就是舞蹈课程啊。\n呜呜，好有压力啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_02_1002_401pro", "source_sha256": "2f935dfad7edbbe5820d9975d3d44c81a9b953cb1bf04e0e074d38e9148cffbe", "ja": "……百合子？　大丈夫か？", "zh": "……百合子？没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_02_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "231c00066fb4ff0fde75e54893f53b9051a294c299b5136948e070df2d9d9d51", "ja": "ひいっ！　ぷ、プロデューサーさん……！\nもしかして、聞こえちゃってました……？", "zh": "呀！制、制作人……！\n难道说，您都听到了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_02_1004_401pro", "source_sha256": "4e50bf41e1cefd90bcc171a8995ca1c1a36458a74627ea0031909fe9a01766be", "ja": "うん……そうか。百合子はダンスに\n苦手意識があるんだっけ。", "zh": "嗯……这样啊。百合子对跳舞有点自卑，是吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_02_1005_026yur", "source_sha256": "a788b1bd2da5dd60183f1eccc81d2b43a38f1bc0224dd650f5aae0e27c27eea4", "ja": "はい……苦手意識というか、苦手というか……。\nあ、他が得意なわけでもないんですけど……。", "zh": "是……与其说是不擅长，不如说是有点怕自己不行……。\n啊，不过其他方面也没什么擅长的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_02_1006_026yur", "source_sha256": "3be33415ec90143d0aac5d666471eef29ca5e6dcf5f85a89c238fd864535353e", "ja": "でも、もうデビューして、今度はテレビに出るのに。\nそんなこと、言ってられませんよね……。", "zh": "可是，我都已经出道了，接下来还要上电视。\n也不能再说这种话了吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_02_1007_401pro", "source_sha256": "365561b5565e25955e8eb3043014f8e3aa0f82a9f39fd6d364ba61965e585bac", "ja": "苦手なことは誰にでもある。\n焦らなくていいんだぞ？", "zh": "谁都有不擅长的事。\n不用着急，知道吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_02_1008_026yur", "source_sha256": "209197354e9ae668c782a62dd6f4c7e59eeb0c5ddab41e9ddf3b2c0116eaa793", "ja": "は、はい……。", "zh": "是、是的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_02_1009_401pro", "source_sha256": "cfffe3e625e9bdaeeca2623964547441eb9b216f3b87fbd0b7be02f51c33c297", "ja": "……。それとも……。\nもしかして、ずっと気にしてたのか？", "zh": "……还是说……\n难道你一直都很在意这件事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_02_1010_026yur", "source_sha256": "08dbeb72980c75b374fae97ae0828b658f5eb41173b09e11ea659debb38a6693", "ja": "……。あの……、私、一期生だったから、\n先輩たちのステージにも結構早く立たせてもらって。", "zh": "……。那个……因为我是第一期成员，\n所以很早就得到了登上各位前辈舞台的机会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_02_1011_026yur", "source_sha256": "c7a4f765df8a4b11793858e10e36601bd6df408feb7506b73c55000ba119886b", "ja": "デビューは南の島でさせてもらって、話題にもなって。\nしかも、立派な写真集まで出してもらえて。", "zh": "我的出道舞台是在南方小岛，也因此引起了话题。\n而且还为我推出了精美的写真集。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_02_1012_026yur", "source_sha256": "dbc0f9bf2103d30f0ea5ddf1994b78c207aedcc77facebe4f25ecaebee36acf6", "ja": "気がつけば、とうとうテレビにも出ることになって。\nしかも友達が見てる番組に！", "zh": "回过神来，没想到我终于也要上电视了。\n而且还是在朋友们正在看的节目里！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_02_1013_026yur", "source_sha256": "8f7ede96409c8e1d4388788af70c73099fcc78c49005b314a950c1b4d0515467", "ja": "でも……、私は全然成長できてないんです。\nもうアイドルなのに、ダンスもずっと苦手なままで……", "zh": "可是……我完全没有成长。\n明明已经是偶像了，跳舞却一直都不擅长……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_02_1014_401pro", "source_sha256": "4330c8cd743c646e5b2ce2a2b230b2730ab7f3c19351495d14a7570c1fc20628", "ja": "そっか……。ここまであっという間だったし、\n自分のイメージが追いつかないのかもな……。", "zh": "这样啊……一路走到现在，时间过得太快了，也许是对自己的认知还没跟上吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_02_1015_401pro", "source_sha256": "483295f6c02072e1c427e82feaa953a03654e3687496fc28849ac2ce0b0efdb4", "ja": "でも成長できてないっていうのは、絶対に違うぞ。\n百合子はすごく成長してる！", "zh": "但要说你没有成长，那绝对不对。百合子，你已经成长了很多！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_02_1016_026yur", "source_sha256": "06ebce82a0712083d24559deaf0a45639f033479041cf8fff91e1364b39f85ef", "ja": "えっ？　ど、どこがですか！？", "zh": "诶？哪、哪里有啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_02_1017_401pro", "source_sha256": "f03be73897ccaafac34905f48811504df20e6b2055aea5ab55f05eb7df0328fd", "ja": "先輩たちのステージも、デビューイベントも写真集も。\n……全部、立派にやり遂げたじゃないか。", "zh": "前辈们的舞台、出道活动，还有写真集。\n……这些你不都出色地完成了吗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_02_1018_026yur", "source_sha256": "54ab2745022501531f7c79b16f350cd7718cc1fb48abfcd546414cfbfa22d5dc", "ja": "あ。……そ、それはでも、みんなのおかげで……。", "zh": "啊。……那、那个，不过也是多亏了大家……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_02_1019_401pro", "source_sha256": "f6efb02b52e203756d3e23e73f2a8c8c8ebe5c054ca9e8e22d6e781f9f9101ef", "ja": "うん。そのみんなの中に、百合子もいたんだ。", "zh": "嗯，大家之中也有百合子啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_02_1021_401pro", "source_sha256": "5a40539054e330c4f94a18b04e1ebb96b90f50f8e1b16b564a6b75d9a3cb38d6", "ja": "あっという間にここまで来れたのは、\nそれだけ百合子が頑張ったってことだよな。", "zh": "能这么快走到今天这一步，也是因为百合子一直都很努力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_02_1022_401pro", "source_sha256": "5bdde3191640fddc02c3bae3230f40be9e9599dafae677316e2d1ee9a4a80e7d", "ja": "だから、これからも頑張る姿をファンに見てもらおう。\nそれがアイドルだと思う！", "zh": "所以，今后也让粉丝们继续看到你努力的身影吧。\n我觉得，这就是偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_02_1023_026yur", "source_sha256": "38d3ece8a74bb89ff5efa14c4caf2e7b722efe90df233123a7a759778f8ac10b", "ja": "アイドル……。私が……。", "zh": "偶像……我……蕾在线a", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_02_1024_026yur", "source_sha256": "d57b5e5813c168aeddb3048a584cae92b1e97147063eff882b1f19222341d1fd", "ja": "え、えへへ。……あの、ありがとうございます。\nなんだかちょっとだけ、自信が出てきました。", "zh": "诶、嘿嘿……那个，谢谢你。\n不知怎么的，我稍微有了点自信。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_02_1025_401pro", "source_sha256": "da6f18e1c013df375ef9100824b31e09c4a41f09153e0a3f9dbad1ee91b8473a", "ja": "そっか。うん、よかった！", "zh": "这样啊。嗯，那就好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_02_1026_026yur", "source_sha256": "36d7fb62a67b99e38cd1967ad4a8ce864555ce8aa319cda392d347e5fdfcf910", "ja": "ただ私の場合、将来的にも完璧なダンス！とかは、\nお見せできるようになる気がしないので……。", "zh": "不过对我来说，今后恐怕也没法展现出什么完美的舞蹈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_02_1027_026yur", "source_sha256": "c52db99826e42a4ddd9a922a3f8b775867b9d8f62b77e451a7c8a2f10022c8cd", "ja": "せめて、くじけないように……。\n1ページずつでも、ちゃんとページをめくって。", "zh": "至少不要让自己半途而废……\n就算一次只翻1页，也要好好地翻下去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_02_1028_026yur", "source_sha256": "f7e3bb4ca0260aebc6ba49cfa166bbc0d108c5286c9502d9aef0cf3f35989aaf", "ja": "いつかステキな物語として、たくさんの人に\n楽しんでもらえるように。頑張ります♪", "zh": "总有一天，要让许多人把它当作精彩的故事来享受。  \n我会加油的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_02_1029_401pro", "source_sha256": "039e440495580650e9fb705b523b107cb1228f0a6e494f44b6da5bdbf47659ac", "ja": "ああ、俺も全力でサポートしていくよ。\n百合子、二人で一緒に最高の物語を作りあげよう！", "zh": "啊，我也会全力支持你的。\n百合子，我们一起创作出最棒的故事吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_02_1030_026yur", "source_sha256": "ec56d1c0c9cdecd2a7372bd3fff219bbfa3bbf57486a9b92448cc4d6e15b9422", "ja": "う……っ。は、はい……っ！", "zh": "呜……！好、好的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_02_1031_401pro", "source_sha256": "8a63fe1ee0ac957ed73e881005b491f686a11ec0a6ab6e0e8d7daf5c73b823ca", "ja": "あれ。どうして目をそらすんだ？", "zh": "咦？为什么要躲开视线？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_02_1032_026yur", "source_sha256": "633875ec2190153e69c7c1bbcde917499c97070af26ee039ca1599810883e55e", "ja": "だ、だって……。プロデューサーさんの目が、\nとっても……キラキラしてるから……！", "zh": "因、因为……制作人先生的眼睛，实在是……闪闪发亮的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_02_1033_026yur", "source_sha256": "28670f292382a3355d93ae275c20c9e01837f2336609ad10805541e84dde2308", "ja": "ああっ、やっぱりダメ！\nそれ以上見つめないで！　こ、恋しますよ！？", "zh": "啊啊，果然还是不行！\n别再那样盯着我看了！我、我会喜欢上你的哦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0310_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0310_story_02_1034_401pro", "source_sha256": "076d55ecaae782f265d4bad557aed6693eae85176dad5da84f81388c7ed0394d", "ja": "……え？", "zh": "……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
